    given-names: Shrey
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ashx120/cutcell-mechanics"
url: "https://github.com/Ashx120/cutcell-mechanics"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A research portfolio implementation of Q4 immersed plane-stress elasticity
  and J2 Perzyna viscoplasticity with one-way stationary thermal coupling,
  comparing quadtree and non-negative moment-fitted mechanical quadrature
  through reproducible verification studies. Selected temperature-dependent
  elastic and hardening fits are supported; the full paper model is not replicated.
keywords:
  - computational mechanics
  - finite elements
  - viscoplasticity
  - moment fitting
